# SBOM Directory

This directory contains Software Bill of Materials (SBOM) files for ccver.

SBOM files are automatically generated during the CI/CD process and included in the Docker container at `/usr/share/sbom/`.

## Formats

- **CycloneDX JSON**: Industry-standard format for software supply chain
- **SPDX JSON**: Linux Foundation standard for license compliance
- **SARIF**: Security analysis format for vulnerability scanning

## Generated Files

When built by the SBOM workflow, this directory will contain:
- `sbom-cargo-cyclonedx.json` - Cargo dependency tree in CycloneDX format
- `sbom-cargo-spdx.json` - Cargo dependency tree in SPDX format
- `sbom-binary-cyclonedx.json` - Binary analysis in CycloneDX format
- `sbom-binary-spdx.json` - Binary analysis in SPDX format
- `sbom-docker-cyclonedx.json` - Complete Docker image SBOM in CycloneDX format
- `sbom-docker-spdx.json` - Complete Docker image SBOM in SPDX format
